sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(within cluster)
    participant Proxy as rest-proxy<br/>8008/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Marshaler as CustomJSONPb<br/>Marshaler
    participant Stubs as gRPC-Gateway<br/>Stubs
    participant Backend as ModelMesh Inference Server<br/>8033/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,Backend: Flow 1: REST-to-gRPC Inference Request

    Client->>Proxy: POST /v2/models/{model_name}/infer<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS optional)<br/>Auth: None
    Proxy->>Marshaler: Deserialize JSON request<br/>Parse tensor arrays, base64 BYTES
    Marshaler->>Stubs: InferTensorContents (protobuf)
    Stubs->>Backend: gRPC ModelInfer<br/>localhost:8033<br/>TLS optional
    Backend-->>Stubs: gRPC InferResponse<br/>RawOutputContents
    Stubs-->>Marshaler: Protobuf response
    Marshaler-->>Proxy: Serialize to JSON<br/>Convert typed tensors, base64 BYTES
    Proxy-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Client,Backend: Flow 2: Model Metadata Query

    Client->>Proxy: GET /v2/models/{name}<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS optional)
    Proxy->>Stubs: Route to gRPC handler
    Stubs->>Backend: gRPC ModelMetadata<br/>localhost:8033
    Backend-->>Stubs: ModelMetadataResponse
    Stubs-->>Proxy: JSON response
    Proxy-->>Client: Model metadata JSON
